{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43509","headline":"霜菊 · 无名氏","name":"霜菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋尽北风去，律移寒气肃。\n淅沥降繁霜，离披委残菊。\n华滋尚照灼，幽气含纷郁。\n的的冒空园，萋萋被幽谷。\n骚人有遗咏，陶令曾盈掬。\n傥使怀袖中，犹堪袭余馥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}